  "selected_source_bindings": [
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-02e0b50e-d905-4037-8503-93e07fabc304-r2-1",
      "text": "昨日温岚尚未得知银钥匙的用途。",
      "sha256": "d71edf60ed15d4ff1e5b78fe3436b750ce72618b808cd2b2905357b218561c4f"
    },
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-02e0b50e-d905-4037-8503-93e07fabc304-r2-2",
      "text": "今日她读完陈澈的信，才知道银钥匙能打开潮汐档案柜。",
      "sha256": "41c96c66ec39c27477c97b125f46eae2766e676240244fbe12808e6b265c9829"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-e872cc39-0288-4032-a2cc-d4abd0bc9bc2",
      "chapter_id": "ch-1cd1cd47-6f9a-47d4-bde0-a56316feb658",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "sha256": "acdbf3c6f280f8ce238bfd95fffc9f29461689cbd936b4002c519c4f303b5657"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-a43ce12a-6e8c-4a2f-864d-ca3d44e3a663",
      "chapter_id": "ch-5e22318f-8e07-4572-9089-2933c0ab1965",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-0dc5980b-af67-4185-a121-c897a31f78a0",
      "chapter_id": "ch-462f329a-b37b-4bcd-acd3-a9975feb5cd3",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-21e1c9cb-94b1-459c-a789-c2684371e275",
      "chapter_id": "ch-80e7076f-78cb-41dc-8ff5-5af844a2891f",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-aa408d85-5c01-421b-9022-2247925d4a56",
      "source_span_id": "span-e872cc39-0288-4032-a2cc-d4abd0bc9bc2",
      "text": "廊桥钥匙的含义",
      "sha256": "3d99a1a224bc211b22a638a8f187cd974662fc52736efc569d231bb77aa798ff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-d8e13af0-2f8e-47d3-98f6-ceccc02e02fe",
      "source_span_id": "span-0dc5980b-af67-4185-a121-c897a31f78a0",
      "text": "温岚",
      "sha256": "2fdb67447992579f8f9f0c751e36d69fbcaba84c43b2318b010edec750ef1c1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-039fa923-4d6c-4b94-ad89-58d4e941ba93",
      "source_span_id": "span-e3e3b2ad-448f-4e05-b0c5-0878f9083550",
      "text": "没有靠岸，来源未明",
      "sha256": "79fd506cc2927825ff3684e1a00e8fa6f5e8e841cc8d31f5cd4f5f81b1f23b1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-0b25853d-73d2-4d57-8c47-dd10b44df6cb",
